    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, you gotta talk to the doc. but it's just my knees, i don't think it's a big deal. i'm just really uncomfortable right now and i don't want to wait a week for an appointment just for some joint ache. is it really that dangerous? i've taken advil before with no issues. it's just a little ibuprofen, surely that won't do anything major?",
